  "description": "The trail hardtail benchmark\nThe 629 is a fast, light weight and award-winning trail hardtail with handling that’s perfect for making the most of every bit of fun you can find – whether going fast and far in the hills, sessioning singletrack, or lapping trail centre trails. It’s confidence-inspiring geometry and specially selected components have all been crafted to to combine together to unlock your riding potential, wherever you ride. With a perfect 10/10 score from MBR it's the trail hardtail benchmark.\n\nHighlights\n– Light yet tough 6061 T6 hydroformed, multi-butted Singe Chain Ring (1X) frame.\n– 120mm RockShox 35 Gold RL suspension fork.\n– Capable, smooth-rolling 29er wheels + grippy Maxxis tyres.\n– SRAM NX Eagle 1x12 transmission (32T chainring x 11-50 cassette).\n– SRAM Guide T four-piston hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotors front + rear).\n– Whyte Drop.It dropper post (with frame size-specific drop).",
